# Known-good upstream Hermes Agent commit that Choomfie is validated against.
#
# This is the de-bloat/update contract: Choomfie does NOT fork or strip Hermes.
# It runs upstream Hermes, trimmed to a lean Discord profile via config/toolsets
# (see bin/choomfie apply_profile_defaults). To integrate a new upstream release:
#
#   1. choomfie hermes-update --check     # see what's new upstream
#   2. choomfie hermes-update             # git pull upstream + reinstall deps
#   3. choomfie doctor                    # validate the lean Choomfie profile
#   4. choomfie hermes-update --pin       # record the new HEAD here once happy
#
# Roll back / reproduce the known-good build at any time:
#   choomfie hermes-update --to-pin
#
# Format: a single line with a full commit SHA (or a tag/ref git can resolve).
